sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Host
  participant G as Guest
  G->>H: hello (name, fresh)
  H->>G: roster (seats, config, started)
  H->>G: begin (seed, commitments)
  G->>H: act (seq, move)
  H->>G: event (seq, move + dealt tiles)
  G->>H: ack (seq)
  G-->>H: resync (lastSeq) after a gap
  H-->>G: snapshot (seq, state)
